# Environment entries override the centralized production defaults.
# "blog" prioritizes an existing blog/pixel content key; it never filters other blogs.
# "primaryCategory" only controls legacy ordering and remains backward compatible.
# Keep VITE_DOMAIN_CONFIG valid JSON on ONE line. Do not add a trailing comma.
